<title>MEXICO: TABLE-Penoles 1997 6-mo net off slightly.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Penoles 1997 6-mo net off slightly.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>H1 1997			H1 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>     Net		  567.06 million	     575.48 million</p>
<p>     Revs		 3.411 bln		3.757 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     1.391 million		1.673 million</p>
